 "t1": 16.74, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "dog", "kicker": "The project records identify other funding", "text": "A separate $2 million grant", "mark": "A"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.41, 0.62, 1.45, 1.61, 1.89, 2.46, 2.54, 2.8, 3.15, 3.48, 3.8, 4.06, 4.19, 4.31, 4.56, 4.88]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Guy Place opened in 2020. Its project budget identified impact fees and a separate addback.", "t0": 16.86, "t1": 22.32, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "guy", "kicker": "The project records identify other funding", "text": "The Guy Place project budget", "mark": "The"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.58, 0.86, 0.96, 1.25, 2.03, 2.28, 2.66, 3.02, 3.61, 4.0, 4.35, 4.6, 4.68, 5.04]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "In 2026 the Controller said neither project used Downtown Park Fee revenue.", "t0": 22.44, "t1": 26.89, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "correction", "kicker": "The Controller removed both projects from the fund schedule", "text": "The Controller removed both projects", "mark": "The"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.47, 1.08, 1.2, 1.75, 2.0, 2.33, 2.84, 3.07, 3.56, 3.82, 4.03]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The next opening balance was $979 below the earlier closing balance.", "t0": 27.01, "t1": 31.54, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "correction", "layout": "table", "heading": "Two published balances", "context": "Across the fiscal year boundary", "rows": [{"label": "Earlier closing", "value": "$3,712,610"}, {"label": "Later opening", "value": "$3,711,631"}, {"label": "Decrease", "value": "$979"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.39, 0.74, 1.1, 1.29, 1.52, 1.82, 2.49, 2.89, 3.21, 3.37, 3.73, 4.11]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Keep the signs on the two project totals, and the reconstructed change is $980.", "t0": 31.76, "t1": 37.07, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "detail", "layout": "table", "heading": "Reconstructed opening", "context": "Using the printed project totals", "rows": [{"label": "Reconstructed", "value": "$3,711,630"}, {"label": "Later report", "value": "$3,711,631"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.35, 0.69, 0.79, 0.9, 1.11, 1.5, 2.07, 2.27, 2.41, 3.14, 3.6, 3.89, 4.27, 4.61, 4.86]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "That comes within one dollar of the new opening balance.", "t0": 37.19, "t1": 39.76, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "detail", "layout": "table", "heading": "Reconstructed opening", "context": "Using the printed project totals", "rows": [{"label": "Reconstructed", "value": "$3,711,630"}, {"label": "Later report", "value": "$3,711,631"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.45, 0.79, 1.02, 1.35, 1.43, 1.55, 1.73, 2.09]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The records document a correction to the funding source. The unrounded ledger would close the final dollar.", "t0": 39.88, "t1": 44.99, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "correction", "kicker": "The signed project totals reproduce the new opening within one dollar", "text": "What the remaining dollar means", "mark": "What"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.52, 1.0, 1.07, 1.53, 1.64, 1.76, 2.11, 2.82, 3.02, 3.54, 3.85, 4.02, 4.33, 4.44, 4.77]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 45.11, "t1": 47.23, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.63, 0.79, 1.03, 1.11, 1.21, 1.47, 1.75]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "The older schedule attributed two projects to the Downtown Park Fee", "b": "The project records identify other funding", "o": "The signed project totals reproduce the new opening within one dollar"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "number"}